{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6f190cc6-d033-4ed6-ad4b-3e8f0086366f",
    "name": "KareReach AI v1 (Updated)",
    "description": "Updated API collection for KareReach community health assistant backend. Includes authentication, consultation management, offline sync, and AI clinical triage using MedGemma.\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost:8000/api/v1`\n\n**Changes from v1:**\n- Fixed base URL to include `/api/v1` prefix\n- Added profile and refresh token endpoints\n- Added offline sync endpoint\n- Standardized all endpoint paths\n- Added example responses\n- Updated data models to match Flutter app",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "CHW authentication endpoints using phone + PIN",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register CHW",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Jordy Parker\",\n    \"phone\": \"0700000000\",\n    \"pin\": \"123456\",\n    \"region\": \"Northwest\",\n    \"health_program_id\": \"HP-999\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Registers a new Community Health Worker (CHW). Phone must be unique and PIN must be exactly 6 digits.\n\n**Response Example:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Registration successful\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"name\": \"Jordy Parker\",\n      \"phone\": \"0700000000\",\n      \"region\": \"Northwest\",\n      \"health_program_id\": \"HP-999\",\n      \"is_active\": true\n    },\n    \"access_token\": \"1|abc123...\",\n    \"token_type\": \"Bearer\"\n  },\n  \"code\": \"KR-AUTH-201\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"token\", jsonData.data.access_token);",
                  "    console.log(\"Token saved:\", jsonData.data.access_token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"phone\": \"0700000000\",\n    \"pin\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Authenticates a CHW and returns a Sanctum access token. The token is automatically saved to the environment for subsequent requests.\n\n**Response Example:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Login successful\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"name\": \"Jordy Parker\",\n      \"phone\": \"0700000000\",\n      \"region\": \"Northwest\"\n    },\n    \"access_token\": \"4|ptGBVG1E...\",\n    \"token_type\": \"Bearer\"\n  },\n  \"code\": \"KR-AUTH-200\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Profile",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/profile",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "profile"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves the authenticated CHW's profile information.\n\n**Response Example:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Profile retrieved successfully\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"name\": \"Jordy Parker\",\n    \"phone\": \"0700000000\",\n    \"region\": \"Northwest\",\n    \"health_program_id\": \"HP-999\",\n    \"is_active\": true,\n    \"last_login_at\": \"2026-05-06T10:30:00.000000Z\"\n  },\n  \"code\": \"KR-AUTH-200-PROFILE\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Refreshes the access token. The old token is revoked and a new one is issued.\n\n**Response Example:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Token refreshed successfully\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"access_token\": \"5|newToken123...\",\n    \"token_type\": \"Bearer\"\n  },\n  \"code\": \"KR-AUTH-200-REFRESH\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Revokes the current access token."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Consultations",
      "description": "Consultation management endpoints",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Consultations",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/consultations?per_page=15",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["consultations"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "15",
                  "description": "Number of items per page (default: 15)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns a paginated list of consultations created by the authenticated CHW."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Consultation",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"patient_age\": 28,\n    \"patient_sex\": \"female\",\n    \"chief_complaint\": \"Persistent chest pain and shortness of breath\",\n    \"duration\": \"1-3 days\",\n    \"symptoms\": [\"fever\", \"cough\", \"chest_pain\"],\n    \"notes\": \"Patient has a history of asthma.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/consultations",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["consultations"]
            },
            "description": "Creates a new clinical intake record. Status is initially set to 'draft'.\n\n**Note:** You can send either:\n- `duration_days` (integer) - e.g., 3\n- `duration` (string) - e.g., \"1-3 days\", \"Less than 24 hours\"\n\nThe API will automatically convert string durations to days."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Show Consultation",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/consultations/1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["consultations", "1"]
            },
            "description": "Fetches details of a specific consultation, including uploaded images and AI results (if completed)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload Images",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "images[]",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Select up to 3 images (JPG/PNG/WEBP, max 5MB each)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/consultations/1/images",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["consultations", "1", "images"]
            },
            "description": "Uploads up to 3 diagnostic images (JPG/PNG/WEBP, max 5MB each) for a consultation."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Sync Offline Consultations",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"consultations\": [\n        {\n            \"patient_age\": 25,\n            \"patient_sex\": \"male\",\n            \"chief_complaint\": \"Fever and headache\",\n            \"duration\": \"Less than 24 hours\",\n            \"symptoms\": [\"fever\", \"headache\"],\n            \"notes\": \"Created offline\",\n            \"created_at\": \"2026-05-05T14:30:00Z\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"patient_age\": 30,\n            \"patient_sex\": \"female\",\n            \"chief_complaint\": \"Cough and chest pain\",\n            \"duration\": \"4-7 days\",\n            \"symptoms\": [\"cough\", \"chest_pain\"],\n            \"notes\": null,\n            \"created_at\": \"2026-05-05T16:45:00Z\"\n        }\n    ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/consultations/sync",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["consultations", "sync"]
            },
            "description": "Bulk upload consultations created while offline. Returns counts of successfully synced and failed consultations.\n\n**Response Example:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Sync completed\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"synced\": [...],\n    \"failed\": [],\n    \"synced_count\": 2,\n    \"failed_count\": 0\n  },\n  \"code\": \"KR-CONS-200-SYNC\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "AI Analysis",
      "description": "MedGemma AI analysis endpoints",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Trigger Analysis",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/consultations/1/analyse",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["consultations", "1", "analyse"]
            },
            "description": "Triggers the MedGemma AI engine via Ollama. This will analyze the patient data, update the consultation status to 'completed', and store the triage report. Supports a 60-second timeout."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Fetch AI Result",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/consultations/1/result",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["consultations", "1", "result"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves the structured clinical report generated by the AI for a consultation.\n\n**Response Example:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"AI result retrieved successfully\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"risk_level\": \"urgent\",\n    \"probable_conditions\": [\n      \"Upper respiratory infection\",\n      \"Viral fever\",\n      \"Bacterial infection (possible)\"\n    ],\n    \"next_action\": \"Refer to health facility within 24 hours\",\n    \"clinical_notes\": \"Based on the reported symptoms...\",\n    \"red_flags\": [\n      \"High fever (>39°C)\",\n      \"Persistent cough\",\n      \"Dehydration signs\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"code\": \"KR-AI-200\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
